                "Description": "<p>Chairperson Orlando Stratman, Vice-Chair Antonio Castillo, Joe Giannini, Sean Glowacz, Vladimir Kovacevic, Scott Morrison, Mike Muir and Ildiko Schultz.<\/p>",
