                "Title": "CONSIDERATION OF MINUTES AND FINDINGS OF THE COMMISSION",
                "Description": "<p style=\"padding-left: 30px;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 30px;\">A. Minutes of the Planning and Zoning Commission Meeting, on July 16, 2025.&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 30px;\">Motion to approve the minutes.&nbsp;<\/p>",
