                        "Title": "85 South Old Rand Road and 100 Park Ave -- Plat of Consolidation (2025-14)",
                        "Description": "<p>Application for a Plat of Consolidation to consolidate various parcels and lots and to provide for a public utility easement.<\/p>\n<p><em>Applicant: Village of Lake Zurich<\/em><\/p>\n<p><em>Owners: Village of Lake Zurich and Jump Co LLC Park Ave Series<\/em><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>",
