                        "Title": "0 Manchester Road -- Meadow Wood East Subdivision -- Final Plan (2025-09)",
                        "Description": "<p>Application for Final Plan approval of a residential subdivision consisting of 15 single-family homes on approximately 8 acres.<\/p>\n<p><em>Applicant: Mike Naumowicz<\/em><\/p>\n<p><em>Owner: Mary Christine Misik<\/em><\/p>",
