                "JurisdictionUUID": "",
                "Title": "PUBLIC HEARING",
                "Description": "<p>(This agenda item includes proposals presented to the Planning &amp; Zoning Commission requiring public testimony, discussion and recommendation to the Village Board for final action.)&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><em>Continued Items.<\/em>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>The following item was continued from the July 16, 2025 meeting of the PZC.&nbsp;<\/p>",
